msgstr ""

#: ../../../ros2_sim_interfaces.md:209
msgid ""
"Only an empty string or \"world\" can be used in the `frame_id` field of "
"`PoseStamped` messages. We plan to add support for using frames known to "
"`Tf` in the future."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ros2_sim_interfaces.md:210
msgid "Entity namespaces are not supported by the `SpawnEntity` service."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ros2_sim_interfaces.md:211
msgid ""
"When spawning an entity, if `SpawnEntity.allow_renaming` is set to `true` "
"and a rename occurs in Gazebo, the new name is not returned in the `Result` "
"object return by the `SpawnEntity` service."
msgstr ""
